From 9f31fa8d943fb3a6a42c827cf8da688cf381bae6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gatien Chevallier <gatien.chevallier@foss.st.com>
Date: Mon, 30 Oct 2023 14:26:35 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 0021/1695] plat-stm32mp2: add new platform support

Initial configuration for STM32MP2x platforms.
Add the initial memory layout and the MMU bus reference
addresses. Default RAM size is 4GBytes
It adds also the console initialization and GIC support.

There are no shared resources on STM32MP25x platforms. Use
stm32_pinctrl_set_secure_cfg() API in the STM32 UART driver for now.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 84e8c194be91384b8983c600e6ab4201c5c29c62 plat-stm32mp2: add new platform support]
